{"blocks": [{"type": "paragraph", "text": "こんにちは"}, {"type": "paragraph", "text": "森平麗心です！"}, {"type": "break"}, {"type": "paragraph", "text": "最近6期生全国ツアー2026！"}, {"type": "paragraph", "text": "どんどん楽しみになってきました"}, {"type": "break"}, {"type": "paragraph", "text": "同期と頑張れることは本当に幸せなんです。"}, {"type": "paragraph", "text": "頑張るぞー！"}, {"type": "break"}, {"type": "paragraph", "text": "そして、6期生のグラビア企画「6期生グラビア Nogizaka Colors」がスタートしました！🎬"}, {"type": "break"}, {"type": "paragraph", "text": "毎日1人づつ公開されていきます！"}, {"type": "image", "src": "https://www.nogizaka46.com/files/46/diary/n46/MEMBER/moblog/202610/mobhyN548.jpg", "alt": ""}, {"type": "paragraph", "text": "そして誕生日に私のグラビア写真が公開されました〜"}, {"type": "break"}, {"type": "paragraph", "text": "1人ひとり時間をかけて撮ってくださったんです😿"}, {"type": "paragraph", "text": "愛ですね"}, {"type": "image", "src": "https://www.nogizaka46.com/files/46/diary/n46/MEMBER/moblog/202610/mobdAYsEc.jpg", "alt": ""}, {"type": "paragraph", "text": "実はマクドナルドの月見パイ食べてました"}, {"type": "image", "src": "https://www.nogizaka46.com/files/46/diary/n46/MEMBER/moblog/202610/mobyoF17I.jpg", "alt": ""}, {"type": "image", "src": "https://www.nogizaka46.com/files/46/diary/n46/MEMBER/moblog/202610/mobxTfWt2.jpg", "alt": ""}, {"type": "paragraph", "text": "最高で草超えて森ってひーつんが言ってくれたので、"}, {"type": "paragraph", "text": "みんなもぜひ見てください👀"}, {"type": "break"}, {"type": "paragraph", "text": "#Nogizaka Colors"}, {"type": "paragraph", "text": "#ひーつんと昨日ケーキ半分こした"}, {"type": "paragraph", "text": "#誰かと食べるケーキは美味しい"}, {"type": "break"}, {"type": "paragraph", "text": "うるみ"}], "source": "official"}